# Adoption

N5NN remains the home of implementation jobs. Door `0500.band.packs` still holds `0510.colab-tools` and `0511.workflow-colab`. Those batches are not investigations.

Actual Colab investigations are caller-selected pages `0701`–`0799` under `0700.band.colabs`. Each investigation keeps its own `05.NN` passes. Returns stay in `0100` members. Existing N5NN histories and captures stay where they are. A later link is additive. Nothing in this batch renames them.

## Template
`labs/colab-workflow-pass01/TEMPLATE.md` is the contextual brief: role and mode, purpose and question, built state and known gaps, reasons, scope and sources, dependencies, capabilities, method, permissions and stop, and return shape. It tells an unscored Colab to state a qualitative result.

`00.kernel/00.00.01.law/0036.colab/01.md` still contains the historical Ask line `Scores first. Opinion second.` That law page is not edited. The new template does not use it as the default.

## Future callers
These callers need a later route. This batch does not modify them.

| Caller | What it does now | Later bounded test |
|---|---|---|
| `app/librarian.py` | Entry commands are `where`, `validate`, `test-run`, `bridge-test`, `bridge-status`, `bridge-recover`, `clerk-deliver`, `pack-check`, `pack-preview`, `pack-assemble`, `pack-verify`, `prime-status`, `boot-prepare`, `boot-check`, `boot-judge`, `boot-show`, `batch-observe`, and `capture-return`. None opens an N7NN page. | `app/tests/test_entry.py` refuses `00.kernel/00.live.md` as an assignment. Add a colab command test only after a separate release adds the command. |
| `app/context.py` | A path that is `00.kernel/00.live.md` is refused as an input. | Keep that refusal in `app/tests/test_entry.py`. |
| `app/prime_intake.py` | `prime-status` requires one absolute `--registry` and does not discover a default. | `app/tests/test_prime_intake.py`. No colab registry row is added here. |
| `00.kernel/00.live.md` | Derived view. Generator `labs/bootstrap-establish-pass01/render_live.py`. Record `00.kernel/00.00.10.work/0401.goal/06.01.md`. Register `00.kernel/00.00.10.work/0410.imports/manifests/step03-selection-register.tsv`. | `labs/bootstrap-establish-pass01/test_render_live.py`. Do not regenerate the view in this batch. |
| `00.kernel/00.00.10.work/0700.band.colabs/03.md` | The menu waits until recorded investigations exist after review. | Do not write the menu from `show`. |
| `00.kernel/00.00.10.work/0500.band.packs/01.md` | N5NN work lines stay on this door. | Leave `0511.workflow-colab` recorded as an implementation job. |

## First Prime invocation
Use a disposable book. The live book `D:\Git\lib-build\00.kernel\00.00.10.work` is refused.

```text
python -B labs/colab-workflow-pass01/colab_workflow.py propose --book ABS-BOOK
python -B labs/colab-workflow-pass01/colab_workflow.py open --book ABS-BOOK --request ABS-REQUEST --sources ABS-SOURCES
python -B labs/colab-workflow-pass01/colab_workflow.py attach --book ABS-BOOK --page 0701.name --pass 05.01 --package ABS-PACKAGE --expect-digest HEX
python -B labs/colab-workflow-pass01/colab_workflow.py show --book ABS-BOOK
```

`propose` does not create a page. The caller selects the page. Space 0 only. No model, no app command, and no write to `00.live`. The digest algorithm `colab-package-digest/1` is local until Prime aligns it with the reviewed 0510 package. A verified receipt is custody, not acceptance.

## Smallest post-review action
Replace the synthetic package recorded in `integration-fixture.json` with the reviewed 0510 package, then open one disposable investigation. Do not edit `00.live` or `app/librarian.py` in that same step.
